<!-- wp:harlow/box {"tag":"section","htmlAttributes":{"id":"section2","class":"who-we-are section fp-section p-0 jarallax","data-anchor":"2"}} --><!-- wp:harlow/box {"tag":"div","htmlAttributes":{"class":"section-inner p-0"}} --><!-- wp:harlow/box {"tag":"div","htmlAttributes":{"class":"container"}} --><!-- wp:harlow/box {"tag":"div","htmlAttributes":{"id":"ContentPlaceHolder1_infodesign","class":"row"}} --><!-- wp:harlow/box {"tag":"div","htmlAttributes":{"class":"col-md-12"}} --><!-- wp:harlow/box {"tag":"section","htmlAttributes":{"id":"section7","class":"who-we-are section fp-section p-0 jarallax","data-anchor":"2"}} --><!-- wp:harlow/box {"tag":"div","htmlAttributes":{"class":"section-inner p-0"}} --><!-- wp:harlow/box {"tag":"div","htmlAttributes":{"class":"container mt-4"}} --><!-- wp:harlow/box {"tag":"div","htmlAttributes":{"class":"row"}} --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"p-text"} --><p class="p-text">Year after year, real estate projects in Iraq are increasing significantly, which will increase the need for cement production inside the country.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"p-text"} --><p class="p-text">It is expected that the steady population growth, coupled with the annual per capita demand index for cement (ranges between 0.65 to 1.5 tons annually) will increase the demand for cement to 26.6 tons annually and will be doubling to 53 million tons in 2050. (2019 statistics).</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"p-text"} --><p class="p-text">Harlow International Group gained a license to build a 2 million tons per year cement plant in Najaf Governorate to meet the increasing demand for cement.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- /wp:harlow/box --><!-- /wp:harlow/box --><!-- /wp:harlow/box --><!-- /wp:harlow/box --><!-- /wp:harlow/box --><!-- /wp:harlow/box --><!-- /wp:harlow/box --><!-- /wp:harlow/box --><!-- /wp:harlow/box --><!-- wp:harlow/markup {"html":"\u003cdiv\u003e \u003c/div\u003e"} /-->
